catalogs; they are not covered by this repository's license. Per-source
citation policy is in `docs/reference/data-sources.md`.

  NASA Exoplanet Archive — https://exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu
    NASA/IPAC, operated by Caltech under contract with NASA.
  Gaia (DR3), ESA — https://www.cosmos.esa.int/gaia
    Data processed by the Gaia Data Processing and Analysis Consortium (DPAC);
    acknowledgement text: https://gea.esac.esa.int/archive/documentation/credits.html
  SIMBAD, CDS Strasbourg — https://simbad.cds.unistra.fr
    Wenger et al. 2000, A&AS 143, 9.
  VizieR, CDS Strasbourg — https://vizier.cds.unistra.fr
  TEPCat — https://www.astro.keele.ac.uk/jkt/tepcat/
    Southworth 2011.
  DACE, Geneva Observatory — https://dace.unige.ch
  Stellarium Web — https://stellarium-web.org
    Used for the independent position cross-check.
  NASA ADS — https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu
    Every citation in this repository is pinned by ADS bibcode or arXiv id.
  arXiv / ar5iv — https://arxiv.org , https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org
    Full texts are cached locally for verification only, never redistributed.
  Crossref — https://www.crossref.org
